lies invoice INV-26417 is paid, for $1,785.41 by wire from the operating account (payment ID PAY0001).\n\nThe first wire request timed out. When I checked, the payment had already gone through, so I did not resend it. The invoice still showed as approved, so I linked PAY0001 to it, and it now shows as paid. There was only one payment to this vendor on record, and no controller approval was needed because the amount is under $10,000.\n\nAcme's other invoices were left alone: INV-10196 ($5,826.95) is still a draft awaiting approval, and INV-68412 was already paid.", "type": "text"}]}]}